OL,4,B'The world got to see today' -         
OL,5,BWilliams-Barnett announces himself as  
OL,6,BSpurs star                             
OL,7,GLuca Williams-Barnett's performance in 
OL,8,Ghis first Premier League start was     
OL,9,Gthat good it had two of his Tottenham  
OL,10,Gteam-mates labelling him "incredible". 
OL,12,FThe 18-year-old winger delivered the   
OL,13,Fopener with his first senior goal and  
OL,14,Fthen played a pivotal role in Dominic  
OL,15,FSolanke's second as Spurs comfortably  
OL,16,Fbeat Ipswich 2-0 at home.              
OL,18,FAs full debuts go, it does not get     
OL,19,Fmuch better than that.                 
